# OsteoPatch — repo-root ignore rules.
#
# Load-bearing frozen runtime artifacts (recovered source TIFFs, recovered model
# bundles, thumbnails) live under runtime-artifacts/ as a DURABLE RUNTIME
# DEPENDENCY, but they are large/binary and are NEVER committed to git. They are
# reproducible from the frozen manifest (images) + frozen recipe (model); the
# recovery EVIDENCE under runtime-artifacts/recovery/ is small and may be copied
# into aidlc-docs if durable evidence is wanted in-tree.

# Durable runtime data (raw TIFFs, model binaries, thumbnails) — never commit.
runtime-artifacts/

# Python
**/.venv/
**/.webvenv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# Node / Vite
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# SQLite runtime db
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm

# Logs
server.log
server.log.err

# Freebuff agent runtime scratch — editor session state, npm cache, host
# PowerShell profile data. Machine-local tooling noise, never project content.
.freebuff/
